CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_BlaineIntro::
    .string "Hah! I am Blaine, the red-hot Leader\n"
    .string "of Cinnabar Gym!\p"
    .string "My fiery Pokémon are all rough and\n"
    .string "ready with intense heat!\p"
    .string "They incinerate all challengers! You\n"
    .string "better have Burn Heal!$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_RulesExplain::
    .string "You solved my riddles to get here,\n"
    .string "but I have one final test!\p"
    .string "How many Pokémon may a challenger\n"
    .string "bring? The answer is three!\p"
    .string "Not two. Not four. Exactly three.\p"
    .string "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}Do you want to open the Storage\n"
    .string "System to prepare your answer?$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_BlaineReady::
    .string "Correct! Exactly three Pokémon!\p"
    .string "Now, let's see if you can withstand\n"
    .string "my 3000-degree Celsius flames!$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_Refused::
    .string "Hah! Getting cold feet?\p"
    .string "Come back when you can stand the\n"
    .string "heat, kid!$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_StillNot3::
    .string "I gave you the answer myself, and\n"
    .string "still you got it wrong?\p"
    .string "Three Pokémon! Come back when you\n"
    .string "can count that high!$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_BlaineDefeat::
    .string "I have burned down to nothing! Not\n"
    .string "even ashes remain!$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_BadgeDelivery1::
    .string "You have earned the Volcano Badge.$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_BadgeDelivery2::
    .string "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{PLAYER} received the Volcano Badge\n"
    .string "from Blaine!$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_BadgeDelivery3::
    .string "The Volcano Badge heightens the\n"
    .string "Special stats of your Pokémon.$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_BlaineTakeSecretKey::
    .string "Kid, before I forget, return to me\n"
	.string "the Secret Key.\p"
	.string "I must ready the Gym for the next\n"
    .string "challenger.\p"
	.string "Don't worry, though. My doors stay\n"
	.string "open to you!$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_BlaineReturnedSecretKey::
	.string "{PLAYER} handed the Secret Key\n"
	.string "to Leader Blaine.$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_TakeThisWithYou::
    .string "Here's a fair compensation!$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_ReceivedTM38FromBlaine::
    .string "{PLAYER} received TM38\n"
    .string "from Blaine.$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_ExplainTM38::
    .string "TM38 contains Fire Blast, the ultimate\n"
    .string "Fire-type technique.\p"
    .string "Vulpix or Charmeleon would be ideal\n"
    .string "for that move.\p"
    .string "Just don't waste it on Water Pokémon.$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_BlainePostBattle::
    .string "You extinguished my flames, kid. I\n"
    .string "went down in a blaze of glory!$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_BlaineRematchIntro::
    .string "Hah! Look who's back!\p"
    .string "The kid who solved every riddle and\n"
    .string "doused my flames.\p"
    .string "Champion now, no less!\p"
    .string "It's been so boring since our last\n"
    .string "battle, I've considered retiring.\p"
    .string "I'm glad you stopped by for one last\n"
    .string "quiz and one last blaze!$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_BlaineRematchRules::
    .string "Oh! I have a new riddle for you!\p"
    .string "The League finally gave us Double\n"
    .string "Battles. About time!\p"
    .string "Two Pokémon on the field at once!\n"
    .string "You'll need four Pokémon in total!\p"
    .string "After years of asking, here it is!\n"
    .string "Think about it! Twice the heat!\p"
    .string "Hope you have Burn Heal or Rawst\n"
    .string "Berry, hah!\p"
    .string "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}Do you want to open the Storage\n"
    .string "System to prepare your party?$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_BlaineRematchReady::
    .string "Hah! That's a Champion's team! Now,\n"
    .string "let's light it up!$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_RefusedRematch::
    .string "What? Giving up already? I thought a\n"
    .string "Champion would take the heat!$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_StillNot4::
    .string "Count with me: one… two… three…\n"
    .string "FOUR.\p"
    .string "Maybe you should've gone to school\n"
    .string "instead of becoming a Champion!$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_BlaineRematchDefeat::
    .string "Hah! Reduced to ashes once again!\p"
    .string "I was ready to let the fire die, but\n"
    .string "you've set it ablaze.\p"
    .string "I thought retirement was calling, yet\n"
    .string "this battle warmed my heart.\p"
    .string "This old furnace still has some heat\n"
    .string "to spare!$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_BlaineRematchBeforeReward::
    .string "Hah! You've earned this, Champion.\n"
    .string "Consider it a little gift from me.$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_BlaineRematchAfterReward::
    .string "Speed is the spark that starts a fire.\p"
    .string "When you know your move, strike fast\n"
    .string "and never look back!$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_BlaineRematchPostBattle::
    .string "Keep pushing yourself, Champion.\p"
    .string "The day you stop seeking a challenge\n"
    .string "is the day the fire starts to fade.$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_BlainePostRematch::
    .string "The brightest flame burns quickest.\n"
    .string "Make every moment count, Champion.$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_MakeSpaceForThis::
    .string "Make space for this, kid!$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_RematchNotEnoughPlaceholder::
    .string "$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_OfferPCRetrieve::
    .string "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}Do you want to open the Storage\n"
    .string "System to retrieve your team?$"

@Last line about Blaine

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_ErikIntro::
    .string "Do you know how hot Pokémon fire\n"
    .string "breath can get?$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_ErikDefeat::
    .string "Yow!\n"
    .string "Hot, hot, hot!$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_ErikPostBattle::
    .string "Fire, or to be more precise,\n"
    .string "combustion…\p"
    .string "…Oxygen in the air…\n"
    .string "Blah, blah, blah, blah…$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_QuinnIntro::
    .string "I was a thief, but I went straight\n"
    .string "as a Trainer.$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_QuinnDefeat::
    .string "I surrender!$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_QuinnPostBattle::
    .string "I get this uncontrollable urge to\n"
    .string "steal other people's Pokémon.$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_AveryIntro::
    .string "I've studied Pokémon thoroughly.\n"
    .string "You can't win!$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_AveryDefeat::
    .string "Waah!\n"
    .string "My studies were insufficient!$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_AveryPostBattle::
    .string "My theories are too complicated\n"
    .string "for you to understand.$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_RamonIntro::
    .string "I like using Fire-type Pokémon.\n"
    .string "I just do.$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_RamonDefeat::
    .string "Too hot to handle!$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_RamonPostBattle::
    .string "I wish there were a thief Pokémon.\n"
    .string "I'd use that!$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_DerekIntro::
    .string "I know why Blaine became a\n"
    .string "Trainer.$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_DerekDefeat::
    .string "Ow!$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_DerekPostBattle::
    .string "Our Leader, Blaine, became lost\n"
    .string "in the mountains but good.\p"
    .string "Night fell when a fiery bird\n"
    .string "Pokémon appeared.\p"
    .string "Its light allowed Blaine to find\n"
    .string "his way down safely.$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_DustyIntro::
    .string "I've been to many Gyms, but this\n"
    .string "one best suits my style.$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_DustyDefeat::
    .string "Yowza!\n"
    .string "Too hot!$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_DustyPostBattle::
    .string "Ponyta, Ninetales…\n"
    .string "Those are popular Fire Pokémon.$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_ZacIntro::
    .string "Fire is weak against H2O.$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_ZacDefeat::
    .string "Oh!\n"
    .string "Snuffed out!$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_ZacPostBattle::
    .string "Water beats fire, of course.\p"
    .string "But fire melts ice, so the Fire\n"
    .string "type beats Ice-type Pokémon.$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_GymGuyAdvice::
    .string "Yo!\n"
    .string "Champ in the making!\p"
    .string "The hotheaded Blaine is a Fire\n"
    .string "Pokémon pro.\p"
    .string "Douse his spirits with water!\p"
    .string "You'd better take some\n"
    .string "Burn Heals, too.$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_GymGuyPostVictory::
    .string "{PLAYER}!\n"
    .string "You beat that firebrand!$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_GymStatue::
    .string "Cinnabar Pokémon Gym\n"
    .string "Leader: Blaine\p"
    .string "Winning Trainers:\n"
    .string "{RIVAL}$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_GymStatuePlayerWon::
    .string "Cinnabar Pokémon Gym\n"
    .string "Leader: Blaine\p"
    .string "Winning Trainers:\n"
    .string "{RIVAL}, {PLAYER}$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_PokemonQuizRules::
    .string "Pokémon Quiz!\p"
    .string "Get it right, and the door opens to\n"
    .string "the next room.\p"
    .string "Get it wrong, and face a Trainer!\p"
    .string "If you want to conserve your\n"
    .string "Pokémon for the Gym …\p"
    .string "Then get it right!\n"
    .string "Here we go!$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_QuizQuestion1::
    .string "Caterpie evolves into Metapod?$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_QuizQuestion2::
    .string "There are nine certified Pokémon\n"
    .string "League Badges?$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_QuizQuestion3::
    .string "Poliwag evolves three times?$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_QuizQuestion4::
    .string "Are electric moves effective\n"
    .string "against Ground-type Pokémon?$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_QuizQuestion5::
    .string "Pokémon of the same kind and level\n"
    .string "are not identical?$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_QuizQuestion6::
    .string "TM28 contains Tombstony?$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_CorrectGoOnThrough::
    .string "You're absolutely correct!\p"
    .string "Go on through!$"

CinnabarIsland_Gym_Text_SorryBadCall::
    .string "Sorry!\n"
    .string "Bad call!$"
